## Deploy in one click

This repo doubles as a template — `npm run build` emits a plain static `dist/`, so it deploys anywhere that serves files:

<a class="btn primary" href="https://vercel.com/new/clone?repository-url=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FZVN-DEV%2Fdarkmown">Deploy to Vercel</a>
